---
// Component: Faq.astro
---
<!-- 13. CCTV INSTALLATION FAQS (WIREFRAME BLOCK 13 - ALL 12 QUESTIONS) -->
  <section id="faqs" class="py-20 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-900/60 border-y border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      
      <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-14">
        <span class="text-xs font-black text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 uppercase tracking-widest px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-blue-50 dark:bg-blue-950/50 border border-blue-200 dark:border-blue-800/50">
          Frequently Asked Questions
        </span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-3 tracking-tight">
          CCTV Installation FAQs
        </h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 text-sm sm:text-base mt-2">
          Straightforward answers to the 12 most common questions about security camera systems in Queensland.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 max-w-5xl lg:max-w-6xl mx-auto items-start">
        
        <!-- Left Column: Odds (1, 3, 5, 7, 9, 11) -->
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <!-- FAQ 1 -->
          <div class="glass-box rounded-2xl p-4 sm:p-5 border border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10 transition-all" id="faq-card-1">
            <button type="button" onclick="toggleFaq(1)" class="w-full min-h-[44px] sm:min-h-[48px] flex items-center justify-between text-left font-bold text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-900 dark:text-white cursor-pointer group">
              <span class="group-hover:text-blue-600 dark:group-hover:text-blue-400 transition-colors leading-snug">How much does CCTV installation cost?</span>
              <span id="faq-icon-1" class="w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-blue-50 dark:bg-blue-950/60 border border-blue-200 dark:border-blue-800/60 text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 flex items-center justify-center text-lg font-mono ml-3 shrink-0 transition-all duration-300 select-none">+</span>
            </button>
            <div id="faq-wrapper-1" class="faq-accordion-wrapper">
              <div class="faq-accordion-inner">
                <div class="pt-3 mt-3 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10 text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed font-normal">
                  Basic customer-supplied (BYO) installations start from $490 for single-storey homes. Complete 4-camera 4K commercial-grade PoE packages start from $1,690 inc. GST, including cameras, 4K NVR recorder, 2TB hard drive, concealed cabling, and mobile app configuration.
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- FAQ 3 -->
          <div class="glass-box rounded-2xl p-4 sm:p-5 border border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10 transition-all" id="faq-card-3">
            <button type="button" onclick="toggleFaq(3)" class="w-full min-h-[44px] sm:min-h-[48px] flex items-center justify-between text-left font-bold text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-900 dark:text-white cursor-pointer group">
              <span class="group-hover:text-blue-600 dark:group-hover:text-blue-400 transition-colors leading-snug">Is wired CCTV better than wireless?</span>
              <span id="faq-icon-3" class="w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-blue-50 dark:bg-blue-950/60 border border-blue-200 dark:border-blue-800/60 text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 flex items-center justify-center text-lg font-mono ml-3 shrink-0 transition-all duration-300 select-none">+</span>
            </button>
            <div id="faq-wrapper-3" class="faq-accordion-wrapper">
              <div class="faq-accordion-inner">
                <div class="pt-3 mt-3 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10 text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed font-normal">
                  Yes, for permanent properties. Wired Power-over-Ethernet (PoE) records 24/7 without battery dropouts, never suffers from Wi-Fi dropouts or wireless jamming, and provides significantly higher 4K bitrate video without monthly cloud subscription fees.
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- FAQ 5 -->
          <div class="glass-box rounded-2xl p-4 sm:p-5 border border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10 transition-all" id="faq-card-5">
            <button type="button" onclick="toggleFaq(5)" class="w-full min-h-[44px] sm:min-h-[48px] flex items-center justify-between text-left font-bold text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-900 dark:text-white cursor-pointer group">
              <span class="group-hover:text-blue-600 dark:group-hover:text-blue-400 transition-colors leading-snug">Does CCTV record when the internet is down?</span>
              <span id="faq-icon-5" class="w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-blue-50 dark:bg-blue-950/60 border border-blue-200 dark:border-blue-800/60 text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 flex items-center justify-center text-lg font-mono ml-3 shrink-0 transition-all duration-300 select-none">+</span>
            </button>
            <div id="faq-wrapper-5" class="faq-accordion-wrapper">
              <div class="faq-accordion-inner">
                <div class="pt-3 mt-3 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10 text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed font-normal">
                  Yes! With wired NVR systems, recording occurs locally onto the internal surveillance hard drive. Even if your NBN internet is completely offline, all cameras continue recording at full resolution without interruption.
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- FAQ 7 -->
          <div class="glass-box rounded-2xl p-4 sm:p-5 border border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10 transition-all" id="faq-card-7">
            <button type="button" onclick="toggleFaq(7)" class="w-full min-h-[44px] sm:min-h-[48px] flex items-center justify-between text-left font-bold text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-900 dark:text-white cursor-pointer group">
              <span class="group-hover:text-blue-600 dark:group-hover:text-blue-400 transition-colors leading-snug">Can I install my own cameras?</span>
              <span id="faq-icon-7" class="w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-blue-50 dark:bg-blue-950/60 border border-blue-200 dark:border-blue-800/60 text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 flex items-center justify-center text-lg font-mono ml-3 shrink-0 transition-all duration-300 select-none">+</span>
            </button>
            <div id="faq-wrapper-7" class="faq-accordion-wrapper">
              <div class="faq-accordion-inner">
                <div class="pt-3 mt-3 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10 text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed font-normal">
                  Yes! Under Queensland law, running telecommunications cabling requires an ACMA-registered open cabler. With our "BYO Installation" service, you supply the hardware (Swann, Reolink, Eufy, Hikvision, etc.) and our licensed technician handles the concealed in-roof Cat6 cabling, weatherproof mounting, and configuration with full written workmanship warranty.
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- FAQ 9 -->
          <div class="glass-box rounded-2xl p-4 sm:p-5 border border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10 transition-all" id="faq-card-9">
            <button type="button" onclick="toggleFaq(9)" class="w-full min-h-[44px] sm:min-h-[48px] flex items-center justify-between text-left font-bold text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-900 dark:text-white cursor-pointer group">
              <span class="group-hover:text-blue-600 dark:group-hover:text-blue-400 transition-colors leading-snug">How are cables run in a two-storey home?</span>
              <span id="faq-icon-9" class="w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-blue-50 dark:bg-blue-950/60 border border-blue-200 dark:border-blue-800/60 text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 flex items-center justify-center text-lg font-mono ml-3 shrink-0 transition-all duration-300 select-none">+</span>
            </button>
            <div id="faq-wrapper-9" class="faq-accordion-wrapper">
              <div class="faq-accordion-inner">
                <div class="pt-3 mt-3 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10 text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed font-normal">
                  In double-storey Logan homes, cables are routed through upper roof cavities, cavity wall drops, downpipe conduits, or inter-floor wardrobe penetrations. We inspect your home's structural framing upfront to ensure neat, concealed cabling pathways without unsightly surface wires.
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- FAQ 11 -->
          <div class="glass-box rounded-2xl p-4 sm:p-5 border border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10 transition-all" id="faq-card-11">
            <button type="button" onclick="toggleFaq(11)" class="w-full min-h-[44px] sm:min-h-[48px] flex items-center justify-between text-left font-bold text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-900 dark:text-white cursor-pointer group">
              <span class="group-hover:text-blue-600 dark:group-hover:text-blue-400 transition-colors leading-snug">What is the difference between DVR and NVR?</span>
              <span id="faq-icon-11" class="w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-blue-50 dark:bg-blue-950/60 border border-blue-200 dark:border-blue-800/60 text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 flex items-center justify-center text-lg font-mono ml-3 shrink-0 transition-all duration-300 select-none">+</span>
            </button>
            <div id="faq-wrapper-11" class="faq-accordion-wrapper">
              <div class="faq-accordion-inner">
                <div class="pt-3 mt-3 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10 text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed font-normal">
                  A DVR (Digital Video Recorder) connects to older analogue cameras via thick coaxial cables and processes video inside the recorder. An NVR (Network Video Recorder) connects to modern digital IP cameras over sleek Cat6 Ethernet cables (PoE), delivering true 4K resolution, AI human/vehicle detection, and superior remote access reliability.
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Right Column: Evens (2, 4, 6, 8, 10, 12) -->
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <!-- FAQ 2 -->
          <div class="glass-box rounded-2xl p-4 sm:p-5 border border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10 transition-all" id="faq-card-2">
            <button type="button" onclick="toggleFaq(2)" class="w-full min-h-[44px] sm:min-h-[48px] flex items-center justify-between text-left font-bold text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-900 dark:text-white cursor-pointer group">
              <span class="group-hover:text-blue-600 dark:group-hover:text-blue-400 transition-colors leading-snug">How many cameras does my property need?</span>
              <span id="faq-icon-2" class="w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-blue-50 dark:bg-blue-950/60 border border-blue-200 dark:border-blue-800/60 text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 flex items-center justify-center text-lg font-mono ml-3 shrink-0 transition-all duration-300 select-none">+</span>
            </button>
            <div id="faq-wrapper-2" class="faq-accordion-wrapper">
              <div class="faq-accordion-inner">
                <div class="pt-3 mt-3 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10 text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed font-normal">
                  Most typical Logan suburban single-family and multi-storey homes require 4 to 6 cameras: covering the front driveway, front entry/porch, side gate access, and rear entertaining patio. Commercial premises typically need 6 to 12 cameras depending on cash registers, aisles, and delivery docks.
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- FAQ 4 -->
          <div class="glass-box rounded-2xl p-4 sm:p-5 border border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10 transition-all" id="faq-card-4">
            <button type="button" onclick="toggleFaq(4)" class="w-full min-h-[44px] sm:min-h-[48px] flex items-center justify-between text-left font-bold text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-900 dark:text-white cursor-pointer group">
              <span class="group-hover:text-blue-600 dark:group-hover:text-blue-400 transition-colors leading-snug">Can I view the cameras on my phone?</span>
              <span id="faq-icon-4" class="w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-blue-50 dark:bg-blue-950/60 border border-blue-200 dark:border-blue-800/60 text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 flex items-center justify-center text-lg font-mono ml-3 shrink-0 transition-all duration-300 select-none">+</span>
            </button>
            <div id="faq-wrapper-4" class="faq-accordion-wrapper">
              <div class="faq-accordion-inner">
                <div class="pt-3 mt-3 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10 text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed font-normal">
                  Yes. We set up official secure P2P mobile viewing on all household iPhones, Android devices, and iPads. You can check live video, playback past recordings, and receive instant push notifications when human motion is detected.
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- FAQ 6 -->
          <div class="glass-box rounded-2xl p-4 sm:p-5 border border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10 transition-all" id="faq-card-6">
            <button type="button" onclick="toggleFaq(6)" class="w-full min-h-[44px] sm:min-h-[48px] flex items-center justify-between text-left font-bold text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-900 dark:text-white cursor-pointer group">
              <span class="group-hover:text-blue-600 dark:group-hover:text-blue-400 transition-colors leading-snug">How long is footage stored?</span>
              <span id="faq-icon-6" class="w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-blue-50 dark:bg-blue-950/60 border border-blue-200 dark:border-blue-800/60 text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 flex items-center justify-center text-lg font-mono ml-3 shrink-0 transition-all duration-300 select-none">+</span>
            </button>
            <div id="faq-wrapper-6" class="faq-accordion-wrapper">
              <div class="faq-accordion-inner">
                <div class="pt-3 mt-3 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10 text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed font-normal">
                  A standard 4-camera 4K system with a 2TB surveillance hard drive stores approximately 21 to 30 days of continuous footage before automatically overwriting the oldest day. For larger storage requirements, 4TB, 8TB, or 16TB drives are available.
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- FAQ 8 -->
          <div class="glass-box rounded-2xl p-4 sm:p-5 border border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10 transition-all" id="faq-card-8">
            <button type="button" onclick="toggleFaq(8)" class="w-full min-h-[44px] sm:min-h-[48px] flex items-center justify-between text-left font-bold text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-900 dark:text-white cursor-pointer group">
              <span class="group-hover:text-blue-600 dark:group-hover:text-blue-400 transition-colors leading-snug">What warranty applies to equipment and workmanship?</span>
              <span id="faq-icon-8" class="w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-blue-50 dark:bg-blue-950/60 border border-blue-200 dark:border-blue-800/60 text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 flex items-center justify-center text-lg font-mono ml-3 shrink-0 transition-all duration-300 select-none">+</span>
            </button>
            <div id="faq-wrapper-8" class="faq-accordion-wrapper">
              <div class="faq-accordion-inner">
                <div class="pt-3 mt-3 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10 text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed font-normal">
                  We provide separate, clear guarantees: All supplied commercial cameras and NVR recorders include a 3-Year manufacturer equipment replacement warranty. In addition, CCTV Logan backs all installations with our written 5-Year cabling and workmanship warranty covering brackets, internal cabling, and terminations.
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- FAQ 10 -->
          <div class="glass-box rounded-2xl p-4 sm:p-5 border border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10 transition-all" id="faq-card-10">
            <button type="button" onclick="toggleFaq(10)" class="w-full min-h-[44px] sm:min-h-[48px] flex items-center justify-between text-left font-bold text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-900 dark:text-white cursor-pointer group">
              <span class="group-hover:text-blue-600 dark:group-hover:text-blue-400 transition-colors leading-snug">Do cameras have night vision?</span>
              <span id="faq-icon-10" class="w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-blue-50 dark:bg-blue-950/60 border border-blue-200 dark:border-blue-800/60 text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 flex items-center justify-center text-lg font-mono ml-3 shrink-0 transition-all duration-300 select-none">+</span>
            </button>
            <div id="faq-wrapper-10" class="faq-accordion-wrapper">
              <div class="faq-accordion-inner">
                <div class="pt-3 mt-3 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10 text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed font-normal">
                  Yes. Every camera we install features advanced low-light optics: either Smart Infrared (IR) night vision reaching 30-50 metres, or ColorVu / Full-Color technology using ultra-wide F1.0 apertures to capture vivid full-colour video even in complete midnight pitch darkness.
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- FAQ 12 -->
          <div class="glass-box rounded-2xl p-4 sm:p-5 border border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10 transition-all" id="faq-card-12">
            <button type="button" onclick="toggleFaq(12)" class="w-full min-h-[44px] sm:min-h-[48px] flex items-center justify-between text-left font-bold text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-900 dark:text-white cursor-pointer group">
              <span class="group-hover:text-blue-600 dark:group-hover:text-blue-400 transition-colors leading-snug">How quickly can installation be completed?</span>
              <span id="faq-icon-12" class="w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-blue-50 dark:bg-blue-950/60 border border-blue-200 dark:border-blue-800/60 text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 flex items-center justify-center text-lg font-mono ml-3 shrink-0 transition-all duration-300 select-none">+</span>
            </button>
            <div id="faq-wrapper-12" class="faq-accordion-wrapper">
              <div class="faq-accordion-inner">
                <div class="pt-3 mt-3 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10 text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed font-normal">
                  Standard residential installations (4 to 6 cameras) are completed within a single day, typically taking 4 to 7 hours including camera positioning, cabling, and smartphone demonstration. We generally dispatch within 48 to 72 hours of quote approval.
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>
  </section>
